197
00:09:43,230 --> 00:09:44,150
They published my paper.
他們發表了我的論文。

198
00:09:44,370 --> 00:09:44,930
Really?
真的嗎？

199
00:09:44,990 --> 00:09:49,290
Yeah, statistical deviations in the carbon dating of fossilized algae, colon,
是的，化石藻類、結腸的碳測年有統計偏差，

200
