There he is.
他就在那裡。

206
00:10:16,150 --> 00:10:17,830
Hey, real...
嘿嘿，真的...

207
00:10:17,830 --> 00:10:18,070
Oh.
哦。

208
00:10:18,250 --> 00:10:18,570
Fortune.
財富。

209
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,410
This guy's so stupid.
這傢伙太傻了。

210
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:24,270
It's Count Rushmore.
這是拉什莫爾伯爵。

211
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:30,330
You know, you should really go on this show.
你知道，你真的應該參加這個節目。

212
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:32,890
All right, listen.
好吧，聽著。

213
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:34,570
I got three tickets to the Rangers tonight.
我今晚拿到了三張流浪者隊的門票。

214
00:10:34,810 --> 00:10:35,270
What do you say?
你怎麼說？

215
00:10:36,170 --> 00:10:37,690
I say I am there.
我說我在那裡。

216
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:39,010
Cool.
涼爽的。

217
00:10:39,650 --> 00:10:40,030
Oh.
哦。

218
00:10:40,470 --> 00:10:41,270
Is Ross going, too?
羅斯也去嗎？

219
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:42,070
No, Janice.
不，賈妮絲。

220
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:43,910
Janice.
珍妮絲.

221
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,610
Because I just...
因為我剛剛...

222
00:10:47,610 --> 00:10:49,410
I feel bad for Ross, you know.
我為羅斯感到難過，你知道。

223
00:10:49,570 --> 00:10:50,670
I mean, we always go together.
我的意思是，我們總是在一起。

224
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:52,710
We're like the three hockey tears.
我們就像曲棍球的三滴眼淚。

225
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:56,830
You know, I may be way out on a limb here, but do
