哦，那個我討厭的女孩？

234
00:11:13,570 --> 00:11:14,650
You guys are crazy.
你們瘋了。

235
00:11:15,450 --> 00:11:15,930
Oh.
哦。

236
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:19,750
Look, I don't hate Janice.
聽著，我不討厭珍妮絲。

237
00:11:19,810 --> 00:11:21,370
She's just a lot to take, you know?
她需要承擔很多，你知道嗎？

238
00:11:24,170 --> 00:11:25,250
Well, there you go.
好吧，就這樣吧。

239
00:11:26,490 --> 00:11:27,570
Hey, come on, man.
嘿，來吧，夥計。

240
00:11:27,610 --> 00:11:28,810
Don't look at me like that.
別這樣看著我。

241
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:30,830
She used to drive you nuts before, too.
她以前也曾經讓你發瘋。

242
00:11:30,930 --> 00:11:31,230
Remember?
記住？

243
00:11:31,510 --> 00:11:33,270
Yeah, well, I'm crazy about her now.
是的，好吧，我現在為她著迷。

244
00:11:33,370 --> 00:11:34,890
I think this could be the real thing.
我認為這可能是真實的事情。

245
00:11:35,010 --> 00:11:36,470
Capital R, capital T.
大寫 R，大寫 T。

246
00:11:38,970 --> 00:11:39,570
Don't worry.
不用擔心。

247
00:11:39,650 --> 00:11:40,490
Those are the right letters.
這些是正確的字母。

248
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:42,810
Look.
看。

249
00:11:44,330 --> 00:11:45,470
What do you want me to say?
你想讓我說什麼？

250
00:11:46,370 --> 00:11:47,970
I want you to say that you like her.
我想讓你說你喜歡她。

251
00:11:48,450 --> 00:11:49,210
I can't.
我不能。

252
00:11:49,230 --> 00:11:49,810
Like her.
就像她一樣。

253
00:11:49,930 --> 00:11:50,210
No.
不。

254
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,810
So you're not even going to try?
所以你連嘗試都不打算嗎？

255
00:11:53,450 --> 00:11:54,290
What's the point?
有什麼意義？

256
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:56,690
It's like this chemical thing, you know?
就像這種化學物質，你知道嗎？

257
00:11:56,970 --> 00:11:59,270
Every time she starts laughing, I just want to...
每次她開始笑的時候，我就想…

258
00:12:02,350 --> 00:12:05,170
Pull my arm off just so I have something to throw at her.
把我的手臂拉開，這樣我就可以向她丟東西了。

259
00:12:07,890 --> 00:12:08,710
Thanks for trying.
感謝您的嘗試。

260
00:12:10,950 --> 00:12:13,990
Oh, and by the way, there is no Count Rushmore.
哦，順便說一句，沒有拉什莫爾伯爵。

261
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:17,690
Yeah, then who's the guy that painted the faces on the mountain?
是啊，那麼在山上畫臉的人又是誰呢？

262
00:12:26,290 --> 00:12:27,790
How could you have told her?
你怎麼能告訴她呢？

263
00:12:27,970 --> 00:12:30,510
Ross, I didn't think it would be that big a deal.
羅斯，我認為這沒什麼大不了的。

264
00:12:30,650 --> 00:12:32,570
Oh, she didn't think it would be that big a deal.
哦，她沒想到這有什麼大不了的。

265
00:12:32,970 --> 00:12:34,890
Okay, who are you talking to when you do that?
好吧，當你這樣做的時候你在跟誰說話？

266
