連你最好的朋友都不行嗎？

279
00:13:09,230 --> 00:13:09,530
No.
不。

280
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:11,330
That is so sad.
那真是太悲傷了。

281
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,850
You're missing out on so much, Ross.
你錯過了太多東西，羅斯。

282
00:13:14,930 --> 00:13:17,910
I mean, the bonding and the sharing, you know?
我的意思是，聯絡和分享，你知道嗎？

283
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:22,110
And knowing that someone else is going through the same thing you are.
並且知道其他人正在經歷與您相同的事情。

284
00:13:23,110 --> 00:13:26,350
So what, you tell each other everything?
那又如何，你們告訴對方一切嗎？

285
00:13:27,710 --> 00:13:28,610
Pretty much.
差不多了。

286
00:13:32,210 --> 00:13:34,830
Did you talk about the night of five times?
你有沒有談過五次之夜？

287
00:13:38,190 --> 00:13:40,810
Do you tell people about the night of five times?
你會告訴別人五次之夜嗎？

288
00:13:41,650 --> 00:13:44,110
Yeah, that was with Carol.
是的，那是和卡羅爾在一起的。

289
00:13:44,230 --> 00:13:46,130
I know, but it's still worth mentioning, I think.
我知道，但我認為還是值得一提的。

290
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:52,510
Relax every muscle in your body.
放鬆身體的每一塊肌肉。

291
00:13:54,050 --> 00:13:57,350
Listen to the plinky-plunky music.
聆聽輕快的音樂。

292
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:04,170
Okay, now close your eyes and think of a happy place.
好吧，現在閉上眼睛，想一個快樂的地方。

293
00:14:05,650 --> 00:14:07,130
Okay, tell me your happy place.
好吧，告訴我你快樂的地方。

294
00:14:07,690 --> 00:14:09,710
Richard's living room, drinking wine.
理查德在客廳裡喝著酒。

295
00:14:09,990 --> 00:14:11,850
No, no, no, not a Richard thing.
不，不，不，這不是理查的事。

296
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:14,430
Just put down the glass and get out.
放下玻璃然後出去。

297
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:17,790
Sorry, but that's my happy place.
抱歉，但那是我快樂的地方。

298
00:14:18,110 --> 00:14:20,650
Well, okay, fine, use my happy place, okay?
好吧，好吧，好吧，用我快樂的地方，好嗎？

299
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:22,810
I'm just, I'm gonna have to ask that you don't move anything.
我只是，我得要求你不要動任何東西。

300
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:25,950
All right, I'll try not to.
好吧，我會盡量不這麼做。

301
00:14:26,430 --> 00:14:32,630
All right, so, you're in a meadow, millions of stars in the sky.
好吧，所以，你在一片草地上，天空中有數百萬顆星星。

302
00:14:33,290 --> 00:14:35,050
Do you think breaking up with him was a huge mistake?
你認為和他分手是個巨大的錯誤嗎？

303
00:14:35,530 --> 00:14:37,470
Okay, there are no questions in the happy place.
好吧，快樂的地方沒有任何問題。

304
00:14:39,010 --> 00:14:44,650
Okay, just the warm breeze and the moonlight flowing through the trees.
好吧，只有溫暖的微風和穿過樹林的月光。

305
00:14:45,570 --> 00:14:46,630
I'll bet he's totally over me.
我敢打賭他完全超越了我。

306
00:14:46,950 --> 00:14:47,850
I'll bet he's fine.
我敢打賭他沒事。

307
00:14:47,970 --> 00:14:50,910
All right, betting and wagering of any kind are, I'm sure, not permitted
好吧，我確信，任何形式的投注都是不允許的

308
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:51,770
in the happy place.
在快樂的地方。

309
00:14:52,470 --> 00:14:52,950
Okay?
好的？

