Okay, this isn't working.
好吧，這行不通。

313
00:15:06,430 --> 00:15:08,950
I'm still awake and now I have to pee.
我還醒著，現在我要小便。

314
00:15:13,170 --> 00:15:14,290
Guess who?
猜猜是誰？

315
00:15:24,210 --> 00:15:25,330
Janice, hi.
珍妮絲，嗨。

316
00:15:25,810 --> 00:15:28,810
You just missed Chandler, but won't you come in before you go?
你剛剛錯過了錢德勒，但你走之前不進來一下嗎？

317
00:15:32,450 --> 00:15:35,570
So, I hear you hate me.
所以，我聽說你討厭我。

318
00:15:37,070 --> 00:15:38,970
I, uh, I never said hate.
我，呃，我從來沒有說過仇恨。

319
00:15:39,310 --> 00:15:40,690
I was very careful about that.
我對此非常小心。

320
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:45,010
A little birdie told me something about you wanting to rip your arm
一隻小鳥告訴我你想撕斷你的手臂

321
00:15:45,010 --> 00:15:46,690
off and throw it at me.
把它丟給我。

322
00:15:48,270 --> 00:15:49,790
You got hate from that?
你因此而產生仇恨嗎？

323
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:52,670
You're taking a big leap there.
你在那裡邁出了一大步。

324
00:15:52,990 --> 00:15:55,130
All right, fine, fine, fine, fine, fine.
好吧，好吧，好吧，好吧，好吧，好吧。

325
00:15:55,210 --> 00:15:58,730
We have got to do something about our little situation here, Joey.
我們必須對我們這裡的小情況做點什麼，喬伊。

326
00:15:59,150 --> 00:16:00,650
So, this is my idea.
所以，這就是我的想法。

327
00:16:00,970 --> 00:16:04,450
You and me spending some quality time together.
你和我一起度過了一段美好時光。

328
00:16:05,830 --> 00:16:07,490
But what does that...
但這有什麼用...

329
00:16:07,490 --> 00:16:08,490
For Chandler.
對錢德勒來說。

330
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:12,010
Okay, I'm in.
好的，我進來了。

331
00:16:12,230 --> 00:16:14,050
Okay, all right, this is what we're going to call it.
好吧，好吧，這就是我們所說的。

332
00:16:14,250 --> 00:16:16,990
Joey and Janice's Day of Fun.
喬伊和珍妮絲的歡樂日。

333
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:20,310
Does it have to be a whole day?
一定要一整天嗎？

334
00:16:20,590 --> 00:16:24,210
Yes, because that's how long it takes to love me.
是的，因為這就是愛我所需要的時間。

335
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:26,530
Yeah, I know.
是的，我知道。

336
00:16:27,310 --> 00:16:28,470
I'll sleep in the next room.
我會睡在隔壁房間。

337
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:37,230
So, do you guys all hate Janice, too?
那麼，你們也討厭珍妮絲嗎？

338
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:38,850
Oh, you hate Janice now?
哦，你現在討厭珍妮絲嗎？

339
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:41,230
Oh, Joey's going to be so relieved.
哦，喬伊會鬆一口氣的。

340
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:45,490
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

341
00:16:48,470 --> 00:16:51,790
Well, look, everybody.
嗯，大家看一下。

342
00:16:51,970 --> 00:16:52,650
It's Weepy.
這是哭泣的。

343
00:16:54,130 --> 00:16:56,330
The mime that cares too much.
太在意的默劇。

344
00:16:57,670 --> 00:17:01,430
I went down to the post office, and it turns out it was
我去了郵局，結果發現是

345
00:17:01,430 --> 00:17:04,970
those videos that I ordered for Richard about the Civil War.
我為理查德訂購的那些關於內戰的影片。

346
00:17:06,410 --> 00:17:08,510
I love the Civil War.
我喜歡內戰。

347
00:17:10,290 --> 00:17:12,150
Monica, do you want us to take you home?
莫妮卡，你想讓我們送你回家嗎？

348
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:14,750
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

349
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:19,430
Or maybe to a galaxy far, far away.
或者也許去一個遙遠的星系。

350
00:17:27,530 --> 00:17:29,690
Women tell each other everything.
女人互相告訴對方一切。

351
00:17:30,050 --> 00:17:31,010
Did you know that?
你知道嗎？

352
00:17:31,290 --> 00:17:31,870
Yeah.
是的。

353
00:17:33,130 --> 00:17:34,950
No, Chandler, everything.
不，錢德勒，一切。

354
